  "title": "COP31 Climate Talks in Turkey: Deep Division Over Fossil Fuels and Climate Agreement",
  "summary": "COP31 climate talks collapsed as countries failed to agree on a climate deal, with key delegates expressing concerns about the lack of mention of fossil fuels. The talks, scheduled to end Friday, faced strong condemnation for not including fossil fuels in the draft document.",
